@node Top
@top Infix

@insertcopying

  Infix supplies reusable Nix libraries, overlays, and flake modules.
This manual explains how to declare NixOS and Home Manager
configurations and generate project files for development shells.  It
assumes that you can write Nix expressions and use flake-parts modules.
@end ifnottex

